/*
  SignalQueryControls.strings
  TeslaSync — P4 shared surface · 0195 · SignalQueryControls (Apple)

  The P1/S10 i18n catalog contribution for this surface. Every key the native surface resolves
  (table "SignalQueryControls") lives here with its web `t(key, default)` English value. These
  entries fold into the app `Localizable.xcstrings` master catalog at integration time; they are kept
  in a per-surface table so each parallel surface prompt owns its own strings without editing the
  shared catalog.

  Group 1 is the exact set of keys extracted from the web source
  (components/SignalQueryControls.tsx) — the From / To / Quick Range / preset aria / Query / Rows copy
  the `DateTimeRangeControls` + `QueryControls` resolve through `t()`.

  Group 2 backs the multi-select chrome, the results-table headers + pager, and the P4 leaf freshness
  / loading / empty / error copy — the strings the web hardcodes inline — so the Swift sources hold no
  English literals. The web search-field prompt copy (its hint text) is keyed as `…searchHint` /
  `…addMoreHint` with the identical user-facing English.
*/

